Instruction on how you created the tools isolation for this product.
Please include platform you installed on, where you installed it, what
you copied where, etc.:

I downloaded the installer from: https://w3-104.ibm.com/software/xl/download/ticket.do?openform.
There you could search the product by the following text: IBM Tivoli Enterprise Console V3.9.
The binary file is named C94MUML.zip.  There is no need to install the whole product to obtain the .jar 
just unpack the .zip file and find both the evd.jar and the log.jar.

Check in the files evt.jar and log.jar to adks/tec/3.9.0 in cmvc.

Note: These files will not be shipped with TDI 7.0.

